  "contentHtml": "<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><a href=\"https://cafe.daum.net/sedu22/F1n/197\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">https://cafe.daum.net/sedu22/F1n/197</a></p><div class=\"figure-open\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-ke-type=\"opengraph\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\" data-og-type=\"website\" data-og-title=\"Daum 카페\" data-og-description=\"\" data-og-host=\"cafe.daum.net\" data-og-source-url=\"https://cafe.daum.net/sedu22/F1n/197\" data-og-url=\"https://cafe.daum.net/_c21_/bbs_read?grpid=1TaBA&amp;fldid=F1n&amp;datanum=197\" data-og-image=\"//img1.kakaocdn.net/thumb/C200x200/?fname=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafe_image%2Fcafe_meta_image_190529.png\"><a href=\"https://cafe.daum.net/sedu22/F1n/197\" target=\"_blank\" data-source-url=\"https://cafe.daum.net/sedu22/F1n/197\"><div class=\"og-image\"><img class=\"thumb_img\" src=\"//img1.kakaocdn.net/thumb/C200x200/?fname=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafe_image%2Fcafe_meta_image_190529.png\" alt=\"\" xxxxonerror=\"this.src=&quot;//img1.kakaocdn.net/thumb/C200x200/?fname=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafe_image%2Fcafe_meta_image_190529.png&quot;\"></div><div class=\"og-text\"><p class=\"og-title\">Daum 카페</p><p class=\"og-desc\"></p><p class=\"og-host\">cafe.daum.net</p></div></a></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">ㄴ 이 글에서 아이디어를 얻어서 도입활동을 만들어봤습니다.<br>&#160;<br>2학기 첫 진도로 6단원을 나가는데 바로 또 공식을 이야기하고 싶지 않아서 찾아보다가.. 등굣길 일기를 적고 에너지를 찾아보는 활동을 해보려고 합니다. 방학 중 한 일에 대해 쓰려고 했는데 공통 상황을 주고 하는 게 더 좋을 것 같아서 이렇게 해보려고 합니다. 아이디어 빌드업 과정과 학습지 ppt 만들 때 ai들의 도움을 많이 받아서 검토가 더 필요할 수 있습니다 ㅠㅠ</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/1bcf19a56e4da5489808981fb806424500d308ee\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/1bcf19a56e4da5489808981fb806424500d308ee\" data-origin-width=\"1280\" data-origin-height=\"720\"></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">[6</span><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">단원 도입 활동</span><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">] </span><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">내 등굣길의 에너지 추적기</span><br><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">등교길 일기 작성 </span><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">TIP (</span><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">어렵게 생각하지 말고 편하게 적어보세요</span><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">!)</span><br><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">&#8226; </span><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">아침에 눈을 떠서 교실 책상에 앉을 때까지의 여정을 시간 순서대로 </span><u><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">최소 </span></u><u><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">5</span></u><u><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">가지 이상</span></u> <span data-ke-size=\"size18\">적어봅니다</span><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">.</span><br><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">&#8226; </span><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">문장 완벽성이나 과학 용어는 신경 쓰지 말고</span><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">, </span><u><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">내가 한 행동</span></u><u><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">, </span></u><u><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">먹은 것</span></u><u><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">, </span></u><u><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">사용한 물건</span></u><u><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">, </span></u><u><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">몸의 상태</span></u> <span data-ke-size=\"size18\">등을 솔직하게 기록하세요</span><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">.</span><br><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">&#8226; </span><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">예시 질문</span><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">: </span><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">알람 소리를 들었나요</span><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">? </span><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">드라이기를 썼나요</span><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">? </span><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">아침을 먹었나요</span><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">? </span><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">엘리베이터나 계단을 이용했나요</span><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">? </span><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">오르막길을 걸었나요</span><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">?</span><br>&#160;<br><span style=\"color: #333333;\">STEP.1&#160;</span><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">아침 눈떠서 교실에 도착하기까지 나의 등굣길 일기 적기</span></p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/f2cd8569142f230bea1eab0cd8a2d76e595f6a7c\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/f2cd8569142f230bea1eab0cd8a2d76e595f6a7c\" data-origin-width=\"1280\" data-origin-height=\"720\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/b0d44cfa6cea04c32ccac5d6a665fad9a0b20ec3\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/b0d44cfa6cea04c32ccac5d6a665fad9a0b20ec3\" data-origin-width=\"1280\" data-origin-height=\"720\"></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: #333333;\">STEP2.&#160;</span><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">내 일기 속 에너지 형태 추적하기&#160;</span><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">(</span><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">선생님 설명 듣고 작성</span><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">! -&#160;</span><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">에너지 종류 힌트 듣기</span></p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/af45e38607843ebd55746cd5467133bc2f67c090\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/af45e38607843ebd55746cd5467133bc2f67c090\" data-origin-width=\"1280\" data-origin-height=\"720\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/c5a792aa218d252fde8f87b562a89fbb9c9e291b\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/c5a792aa218d252fde8f87b562a89fbb9c9e291b\" data-origin-width=\"1280\" data-origin-height=\"720\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/7d3a5eb1530ec8d65e4dd0a38ffd49400b399111\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/7d3a5eb1530ec8d65e4dd0a38ffd49400b399111\" data-origin-width=\"1280\" data-origin-height=\"720\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/b48f79d673b896e4c8e0c6e2708ae3b7f09f6c04\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/b48f79d673b896e4c8e0c6e2708ae3b7f09f6c04\" data-origin-width=\"1280\" data-origin-height=\"720\"></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&#160;<br><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">STEP3. </span><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">내 등굣길에서 </span><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">‘</span><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">높이</span><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">’</span><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">와 </span><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">‘</span><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">움직임</span><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">’</span><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">이 모두 관련된 장면이 있다면</span><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">? </span><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">→ </span><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">(&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160;)</span></p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/ea5f094947e36243cb99659b13b61d62b8ebb958\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/ea5f094947e36243cb99659b13b61d62b8ebb958\" data-origin-width=\"1280\" data-origin-height=\"720\"></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">도입 활동의 결론</span><br><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">&#8226; </span><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">우리가 등교하는 동안 에너지는 사라진 것이 아니라 다양한 형태로 </span><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">(</span><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">　　 　</span><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">)</span><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">되었다</span><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">!</span><br><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">&#8226; </span><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">내 등교길 중 높이</span><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">(</span><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">위치</span><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">)</span><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">의 변화와 관련된 에너지는 </span><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">(&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160;)</span><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">에너지</span><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">, </span><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">움직임</span><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">(</span><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">속력</span><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">)</span><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">의 변화와 관련된 에너지는 </span><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">(&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160;) </span><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">에너지로 </span><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">3</span><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">단원에서 배웠다</span><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">.</span><br><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">&#8226; </span><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">우리는 이번 단원에서는 먼저 </span><u><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">(&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; )</span></u><u><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">에너지와 </span></u><u><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">(</span></u><u><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">　　　</span></u><u><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">)</span></u><u><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">에너지를 합한 새로운 에너지</span></u><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">에 대해 배우게 된다</span><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">!</span></p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/69b672c800b30e8e1f3d03e9ad514b1cd1ee63f2\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/69b672c800b30e8e1f3d03e9ad514b1cd1ee63f2\" data-origin-width=\"1280\" data-origin-height=\"720\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/56099b8dfbfde42d9d095760cc479fd89ddbb90e\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/56099b8dfbfde42d9d095760cc479fd89ddbb90e\" data-origin-width=\"1280\" data-origin-height=\"720\"></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&#160;<br>학습지(학습지 폰트-쿠키런)와 구글슬라이드 공유해봅니다. 슬라이드는 아래 링크에서 사본 만들수 있습니다.</p><div class=\"figure-file\" data-ke-type=\"file\" data-file-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/37b80d52795913a8660cbabd7c29c6e100d28b98?download\" data-file-name=\"[6단원 도입 활동] 내 등굣길의 에너지 추적기.hwpx\" data-file-size=\"145858\" data-mimetype=\"application/haansofthwpx\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\"><a href=\"javascript:checkVirus('grpid%3D1TaBA%26fldid%3DfMHp%26dataid%3D1544%26fileid%3D1%26regdt%3D20260813190658&url=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafeattach%2F1TaBA%2F37b80d52795913a8660cbabd7c29c6e100d28b98')\"><div class=\"image\"></div><div class=\"desc\"><div class=\"filename\"><span class=\"name\">[6단원 도입 활동] 내 등굣길의 에너지 추적기</span><span class=\"type\">.hwpx</span></div><div class=\"size\">142.44KB</div></div></a></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><a href=\"https://docs.google.com/presentation/d/1ihy_9zbsFzcjE_Yu2SW5mhQjY5mkwYNlEn9rqeo_b8Q/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_top\" class=\"ke-link\">https://docs.google.com/presentation/d/1ihy_9zbsFzcjE_Yu2SW5mhQjY5mkwYNlEn9rqeo_b8Q/edit?usp=sharing</a></p><div class=\"figure-open\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-ke-type=\"opengraph\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\" data-og-type=\"website\" data-og-title=\"6단원 도입-등굣길 에너지 추적기\" data-og-description=\"도입 활동 | 오늘의 질문 “내가 학교에 오는 동안, 에너지는 어떻게 움직이고 바뀌었을까?” 에너지를 ‘외우는’ 시간이 아니라, 내 하루에서 ‘찾아내는’ 시간입니다. 내 등굣길의 에너지\" data-og-host=\"docs.google.com\" data-og-source-url=\"https://docs.google.com/presentation/d/1ihy_9zbsFzcjE_Yu2SW5mhQjY5mkwYNlEn9rqeo_b8Q/edit?usp=sharing\" data-og-url=\"https://docs.google.com/presentation/d/1ihy_9zbsFzcjE_Yu2SW5mhQjY5mkwYNlEn9rqeo_b8Q/edit?usp=sharing&amp;usp=embed_facebook\" data-og-image=\"//img1.kakaocdn.net/thumb/C200x200/?fname=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafe_image%2Fcafe_meta_image_190529.png\"><a href=\"https://docs.google.com/presentation/d/1ihy_9zbsFzcjE_Yu2SW5mhQjY5mkwYNlEn9rqeo_b8Q/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\" data-source-url=\"https://docs.google.com/presentation/d/1ihy_9zbsFzcjE_Yu2SW5mhQjY5mkwYNlEn9rqeo_b8Q/edit?usp=sharing\"><div class=\"og-image\"><img class=\"thumb_img\" src=\"//img1.kakaocdn.net/thumb/C200x200/?fname=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafe_image%2Fcafe_meta_image_190529.png\" alt=\"\" xxxxonerror=\"this.src=&quot;//img1.kakaocdn.net/thumb/C200x200/?fname=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafe_image%2Fcafe_meta_image_190529.png&quot;\"></div><div class=\"og-text\"><p class=\"og-title\">6단원 도입-등굣길 에너지 추적기</p><p class=\"og-desc\">도입 활동 | 오늘의 질문 “내가 학교에 오는 동안, 에너지는 어떻게 움직이고 바뀌었을까?” 에너지를 ‘외우는’ 시간이 아니라, 내 하루에서 ‘찾아내는’ 시간입니다. 내 등굣길의 에너지</p><p class=\"og-host\">docs.google.com</p></div></a></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&#160;<br><br>&lt;수업 후기&gt;<br></p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/ae6ffccc956821bf1a1c5f585d86d7870efbc34b\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/ae6ffccc956821bf1a1c5f585d86d7870efbc34b\" data-origin-width=\"2780\" data-origin-height=\"3094\"></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/9aa88f693b7941981ea3926bbb393f160c5dc165\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/9aa88f693b7941981ea3926bbb393f160c5dc165\" data-origin-width=\"2851\" data-origin-height=\"3083\"></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\">일기는 진지하게 쓰고 의외로 발표하면 재밌는 내용들도 많았어요 ㅎㅎ 다양한 등교길을 알 수 있었고 나중에 에너지전환 후반부에도 이 예시들읕 좀 활용해볼까..시험 문제도 응용해볼까 고민중입니다.</p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->"
}